<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Comparison</strong></div>
    <div>noun + <strong>bǐ</strong> + noun + adjective-<strong>de</strong> + comparative</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">狗<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">比</span>猫大<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">得</span>多</div>
    <div>gǒu bǐ māo dà de duō</div>
    <div>The dog is bigger than the cat</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Comparison</strong></div>
    <div>noun + <strong>shì</strong> + <strong>bǐjiào</strong> + adjective-<strong>de</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">猫<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">是比较</span>大<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">的</span></div>
    <div>māo shì bǐjiào dà de</div>
    <div>The cat is bigger</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Comparison</strong></div>
    <div>noun + <strong>shì</strong> + <strong>bù</strong> + <strong>tài</strong> + adjective-<strong>de</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">猫<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">是不太</span>大<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">的</span></div>
    <div>māo shì bù tài dà de</div>
    <div>The cat is not bigger</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Larger extent</strong></div>
    <div>noun / adjective <strong>dà</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">大</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Lesser extent</strong></div>
    <div>noun / adjective <strong>xiǎo</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">小</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Comparative standard</strong></div>
    <div>noun + <strong>yǒu</strong> + noun + <strong>nàme</strong> / <strong>zhème</strong> adjective</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">...有...那么/这么</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">狗<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">有</span>猫<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">那么</span>大</div>
    <div>gǒu yǒu māo nàme dà</div>
    <div>The dog is as big as the cat</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Balanced comparatives</strong></div>
    <div>noun + adjective + noun + adjective</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">狗<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">大</span>猫<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">小</span></div>
    <div>gǒu dà māo xiǎo</div>
    <div>The dog is bigger than the cat</div>
</div>
